{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119580/extras/95b4ca063b92e349544611c866043b72.avif?t=1761909801\" width=600 height=169 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The kingdom of Aetherion is devastated. Its villages are empty, leaving only magical creatures that dominate the lands and regions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119580/extras/301fb4be5010e6fda0a493c1c227aa4b.avif?t=1761909801\" width=902 height=278 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With few remnants of civilization remaining, the kingdom now depends solely on you in this Beautiful and Gigantic world.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119580/extras/211598af20231d62e08142afd54c9117.avif?t=1761909801\" width=902 height=278 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Current Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open World Survival Game for many to explore and survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through a landscape with diverse and unique biomes, and hot and cold climates such as lava and snow.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight all kinds of creatures and zone bosses and much more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bags you need to manage and maintain. Also suitable for portable storage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find many types of weapons, and clothes and different types of equipment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make safe zones and places to take shelter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weather and day/night cycles, be careful.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From doing current activities, improve your ability to do them and unlock new abilities in the skill tree.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online Multiplayer Survival Mode.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119580/extras/04a5da4a268be85e8a6395879bd36e0f.avif?t=1761909801\" width=974 height=396 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4119580?t=1761909801","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119580/7b651d43bdd7401a12ff0021029d1a8b1636133d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761909801","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119580/b1699264ec00f05a5ed3d07f7cc2110d22b43a85/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761909801","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119580/b1699264ec00f05a5ed3d07f7cc2110d22b43a85/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761909801","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119580/extras/95b4ca063b92e349544611c866043b72.avif?t=1761909801\" width=600 height=169 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The kingdom of Aetherion is devastated. Its villages are empty, leaving only magical creatures that dominate the lands and regions.</p><p class=\"bb_